  "generated_text": "Let the zeros of $P(x)$ be $r$, $s$, and $t$. Then the mean of the zeros is $\\frac{r+s+t}{3}$, the product of the zeros is $rst$, and the sum of the coefficients is $2 + a + b + c$.\n\nSince the mean of the zeros, the product of the zeros, and the sum of the coefficients are all equal, we have:\n\\[ \\frac{r+s+t}{3} = rst = 2 + a + b + c \\]\n\nGiven that the $y$-intercept of the graph of $y = P(x)$ is 8, we have $c = 8$.\n\nSubstituting $c = 8$ into the equation, we get:\n\\[ \\frac{r+s+t}{3} = rst = 2 + a + b + 8 \\]\n\nSimplifying, we have:\n\\[ \\frac{r+s+t}{3} = rst = 10 + a + b \\]\n\nSince $b$ is the coefficient of $x$ in the polynomial, we have:\n\\[ b = \\boxed{-10} \\]\nThe answer is: -10",
